          "en": "Lift your knee and draw the biggest circle you can"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cue2",
        "primary": false,
        "text": {
          "zh": "屁股和背不动，只有腿在转。",
          "en": "Keep your hips and back still; only the leg moves."
